1
00:00:24,576 --> 00:00:27,232
I like skateboarding very much.

2
00:00:27,472 --> 00:00:31,504
My friends and I practise at a special park twice a week.

3
00:00:31,952 --> 00:00:35,616
My skateboard is really cool, and so are theirs.

4
00:00:36,224 --> 00:00:38,736
We encourage one another to do tricks.

5
00:00:39,008 --> 00:00:43,872
Some tricks are difficult, but once you succeed, you feel great!

6
00:00:44,128 --> 00:00:47,360
I like skateboarding because it keeps me fit.

